  "$reserved": {
    "1000000000000000007": "MANGA Plus by SHUEISHA. Its API works (protobuf over HTTP, one SESSION-TOKEN header), but every page image is XOR-encrypted with a per-page key the viewer is expected to apply. Nothing in the Source contract can transform image bytes, and the reader/download pipeline that fetches them is a different module, so a shipped source would browse and list chapters and then show a blank reader. Deliberately not shipped.",
    "1000000000000000008": "Bato.to. Every mirror serves a Cloudflare interstitial to plain requests, so its markup could not be read even once; writing selectors against a page nobody has seen is the exact silent-failure mode this catalogue avoids. Needs a FlareSolverr-backed session to be written at all."
  }
